    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buddies in a Ball</strong> is a hilarious co-op adventure that traps you and a friend inside of a metal ball, hurtling through wild, physics-driven obstacle courses. Work together to tackle tight turns, daring ramps, and gravity-defying challenges in multiple, game-show-inspired arenas. Your mission? Survive each level without falling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete each level to uncover the twisted mystery behind why you and your buddy are trapped in this rolling metal death trap. And don\u2019t forget \u2013 the taunting announcers and jeering fans are always ready to push you off your game.<i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/ae39629db402a623916acb111d788af6.poster.avif?t=1754395082\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/ae39629db402a623916acb111d788af6.webm?t=1754395082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/ae39629db402a623916acb111d788af6.mp4?t=1754395082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Gameplay Elements:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teamwork Matters:</strong> Two players control the ball together\u2014communication and coordination are key! Solo mode available too.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Driven Fun:</strong> Realistic rolling physics, speed, and momentum make every level a new challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game-Show Vibes:</strong> The announcer keeps the action exciting, commenting on your triumphs and failures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Levels:</strong> Navigate ramps, jumps, obstacles, and rotating platforms in diverse arenas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards:</strong>\u00a0Compete to finish each level in the fastest time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Characters:</strong> Pick your favorite stick figure styles and colors!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/b444f1bfa75f21159671a17bfe2a8914.poster.avif?t=1754395082\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/b444f1bfa75f21159671a17bfe2a8914.webm?t=1754395082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/b444f1bfa75f21159671a17bfe2a8914.mp4?t=1754395082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy: Access every level, unlimited respawns, no time limits, and explore the world! Leaderboards disabled.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Default: Race to beat the clock, respawn at the beginning of the current level when you fall. Complete each level to unlock the next.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard: 3 lives per act, if you run out of lives, start from the beginning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mentally ill: One life, one game, if you fall, restart from level one. You probably have or need a therapist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo Mode: Jump in the ball alone and take on the course by yourself, weirdo. Leaderboards disabled.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Play Buddies in a Ball?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love physics-based challenges, funny co-op gameplay, and the thrill of surviving impossible levels, this game is for you. Whether you're strategizing with your teammate or screaming at them for rolling the wrong way, each round promises laughs and adrenaline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/a2295b27e276b68350c005928ed0a802.poster.avif?t=1754395082\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/a2295b27e276b68350c005928ed0a802.webm?t=1754395082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/a2295b27e276b68350c005928ed0a802.mp4?t=1754395082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buddies in a Ball</strong> is a hilarious co-op adventure that traps you and a friend inside of a metal ball, hurtling through wild, physics-driven obstacle courses. Work together to tackle tight turns, daring ramps, and gravity-defying challenges in multiple, game-show-inspired arenas. Your mission? Survive each level without falling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete each level to uncover the twisted mystery behind why you and your buddy are trapped in this rolling metal death trap. And don\u2019t forget \u2013 the taunting announcers and jeering fans are always ready to push you off your game.<i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/ae39629db402a623916acb111d788af6.poster.avif?t=1754395082\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/ae39629db402a623916acb111d788af6.webm?t=1754395082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/ae39629db402a623916acb111d788af6.mp4?t=1754395082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Gameplay Elements:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teamwork Matters:</strong> Two players control the ball together\u2014communication and coordination are key! Solo mode available too.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Driven Fun:</strong> Realistic rolling physics, speed, and momentum make every level a new challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game-Show Vibes:</strong> The announcer keeps the action exciting, commenting on your triumphs and failures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Levels:</strong> Navigate ramps, jumps, obstacles, and rotating platforms in diverse arenas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards:</strong>\u00a0Compete to finish each level in the fastest time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Characters:</strong> Pick your favorite stick figure styles and colors!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/b444f1bfa75f21159671a17bfe2a8914.poster.avif?t=1754395082\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/b444f1bfa75f21159671a17bfe2a8914.webm?t=1754395082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/b444f1bfa75f21159671a17bfe2a8914.mp4?t=1754395082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy: Access every level, unlimited respawns, no time limits, and explore the world! Leaderboards disabled.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Default: Race to beat the clock, respawn at the beginning of the current level when you fall. Complete each level to unlock the next.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard: 3 lives per act, if you run out of lives, start from the beginning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mentally ill: One life, one game, if you fall, restart from level one. You probably have or need a therapist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo Mode: Jump in the ball alone and take on the course by yourself, weirdo. Leaderboards disabled.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Play Buddies in a Ball?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love physics-based challenges, funny co-op gameplay, and the thrill of surviving impossible levels, this game is for you. Whether you're strategizing with your teammate or screaming at them for rolling the wrong way, each round promises laughs and adrenaline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/a2295b27e276b68350c005928ed0a802.poster.avif?t=1754395082\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/a2295b27e276b68350c005928ed0a802.webm?t=1754395082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/a2295b27e276b68350c005928ed0a802.mp4?t=1754395082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
